## 3. User Profile System

### Database Schema
```sql
CREATE TABLE user_profiles (
    user_id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    age INT,
    gender VARCHAR(10),
    state VARCHAR(50),
    district VARCHAR(100),
    income DECIMAL,
    occupation VARCHAR(100),
    category VARCHAR(20),      -- SC/ST/OBC/General
    education VARCHAR(50),
    disability_status BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    disability_type VARCHAR(50),
    land_ownership BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    land_hectares DECIMAL,
    business_ownership BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    business_type VARCHAR(50),
    marital_status VARCHAR(20),
    dependents INT,
    profile_completeness FLOAT,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE TABLE user_documents (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    user_id UUID REFERENCES user_profiles(user_id),
    document_type VARCHAR(50),
    file_path VARCHAR(500),
    extracted_data JSONB,
    verified BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    uploaded_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE TABLE user_sessions (
    session_id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    user_id UUID REFERENCES user_profiles(user_id),
    messages JSONB,
    context JSONB,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);
```

---

## 4. Document Intelligence

### End-to-End Workflow
```
Upload → Virus Scan → Classify (Aadhaar/Income/Caste/etc.) → OCR → Extract Fields → Validate → Map to Profile → Store
```

### Document-to-Profile Mapping
| Document | Extracted Fields | Profile Fields Updated |
|----------|-----------------|----------------------|
| Aadhaar | name, DOB, gender, address | age, gender, state, district |
| Income Certificate | income, issuing authority | income |
| Caste Certificate | category, sub-category | category |
| Disability Certificate | disability type, percentage | disability_status, disability_type |
| Land Records | area, type, location | land_ownership, land_hectares |

